x_comment(x_modalProperty,"A &%BinaryRelation that is used to state the \nnormative force of a &%Proposition.  (&%modalProperty ?FORMULA ?PROP) means \nthat the &%Proposition expressed by ?FORMULA has the &%NormativeProperty \n?PROP.  For example, (&%modalProperty (&%exists (?ACT ?OBJ) (&%and \n(&%instance ?ACT &%Giving) (&%agent ?ACT John) (&%patient ?ACT ?OBJ) \n(&%destination ?ACT Tom))) &%Obligation) means that John is obligated to give \nTom something.") :- x_cid(a65b123f7786b2).
